<BaseLayout title="Music" description="Original music and lyrics by Bugsy McRae, also known as Brian ‘Bugsy’ McRae.">
  <main>
    <header class="editorial-hero editorial-hero--music"><div class="kicker">Bugsy McRae</div><h1>Music</h1><p>Some things are better sung than explained.</p></header>
    <section class="container reading"><div class="kicker">The songs are coming</div><h2 class="section-title">Words that found a voice.</h2><p class="lede">Original lyrics and music by Brian “Bugsy” McRae. A listening room is on its way. Soon you'll be able to play the recordings here, explore the lyrics, and share the songs.</p><p class="lede">Until then, stay in correspondence.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="/contact">Get in Touch</a><a class="button" href="/">Return Home</a></div></section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
